hadiths[53]{hadithnumber,text}:
"472","Yahya related to me from Malik from Dawud ibn al-Husayn from al- Araj from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abd al-Qari that Umar ibn al Khattab said"
"473","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"474","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abd al-Qari said that he had heard Umar ibn al-Khattab say"
"475","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"476","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from A'isha"
"477","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said that Abasa (Sura 80) was sent down about Abdullah ibn Umm Maktum. He came to the Prophet"
"478","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"479","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith at-Taymi from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar Rahman that Abu Said said that he had heard the Messenger of Allah"
"480","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that it took Abdullah ibn Umar eight years to learn Surat al-Baqara. (Sura)"
"481","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Yazid"
"482","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi"
"483","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Dinar said"
"484","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from al-Araj that Umar ibn al Khattab recited Surat an-Najm (Sura 53) and prostrated in it"
"487","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ubaydullah ibn Abd ar-Rahman that Ubayd ibn Hunayn"
"488","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Humayd ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf had told him that Surat al-Ikhlas (Sura 112) was equal to a third of the Qur'an"
"489","Yahya related to me from Malik from Sumayy"
"490","Yahya related to me from Malik from Sumayy"
"491","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Ubayd"
"492","Yahya related to me from Malik that Umara ibn Sayyad had heard Said ibn al Musayyab say about abiding good deeds that they were a slave's saying 'Allah is greater' (Allahu akbar) and 'Glory be to Allah' (Subahana'llah) and 'Praise be to Allah' (al-hamdu lillah) and 'There is no god but Allah and there is no power and no strength except by Allah.' (La ilaha illa'llah wa la hawla wa la quwwata illa bi'llah)"
"493","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ziyad ibn Abi Ziyad said that Abu'd-Darda had said"
"494","Malik related to me from Nuaym ibn Abdullah ibn al-Mujmir from AIi ibn Yahya az-Zuraqi from his father that Rifaa ibn Rafi said"
"495","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"496","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"497","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"498","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Ubayd"
"499","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Abdullah al-Agharr and from Abu Salama from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"500","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith at-Taymi that A'isha"
"501","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ziyad ibn Abi Ziyad from Talha ibn Ubaydullah ibn Kariz that the Messenger of Allah"
"502","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'zZubayr al-Makki from Tawus al-Yamani from Abdullah ibn Abbas that the Messenger of Allah"
"503","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zubayr al-Makki from Tawus al-Yamani from Abdullah ibn Abbas that the Messenger of Allah"
"504","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abdullah ibn Jabir ibn Atik said that Abdullah ibn Umar had come to them in Bani Muawiya"
"505","Yahya related to me from Malik that Zayd ibn Aslam used to say"
"506","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Dinar said"
"507","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab used to say"
"508","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said"
"509","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"510","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"511","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"512","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abu'd-Darda used to rise in the middle of the night and say"
"513","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar from Abdullah as-Sunabihi that the Messenger of Allah"
"514","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said that the Messenger of Allah"
"515","Yahya related to me from Malik that al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman said"
"516","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"517","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban from al Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"518","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab used to say"
"519","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid that he saw Umar ibn al-Khattab beating al-Munkadir for praying after asr"
"520","Yahya related to me from Malik from Jafar ibn Muhammad from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"521","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ayyub ibn Abi Tamima as- Sakhtayani from Muhammad ibn Sirin that Umm Atiyya al-Ansariyya said"
"524","Hadith Translation Not Available"
"525","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he had heard that when Abu Bakr as-Siddiq was ill he asked A'isha"
"526","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Humayd ibn Abdar-Rahman ibn Awf that Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As said"
"527","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that the Messenger of Allah"
"528","Yahya related to me from Muhammad ibn alMunkadir that Rabia ibn Abdullah ibn alHadir told him that he had seen Umar ibn al-Khattab leading people in front of the bier at the funeral of Zaynab bint Jahsh"